<DocsLayout locale="en" title="Release and supply-chain security" description="Verify the origin, integrity, and dependency inventory of every installer." section="Release security">
  <Fragment slot="toc"><a href="#assets">Assets</a><a href="#checksum">Checksums</a><a href="#provenance">Provenance</a><a href="#report">Reporting</a></Fragment>
  <h2 id="assets">Release contents</h2><ul><li>macOS PKG and tar.gz.</li><li>Linux DEB, RPM, and tar.gz.</li><li>Windows Setup EXE and zip.</li><li>`SHA256SUMS`, CycloneDX SBOM, and Sigstore bundle.</li></ul>
  <h2 id="checksum">Verify SHA-256</h2><pre><code># Linux
sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS --ignore-missing

# macOS
shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS</code></pre><p>On Windows, compare `Get-FileHash` output with `SHA256SUMS`.</p>
  <h2 id="provenance">Signatures and build provenance</h2><p>The release workflow uses GitHub OIDC for keyless Sigstore signatures and build provenance. Verify the repository, workflow identity, and tag together.</p>
  <h2 id="report">Report a security issue</h2><p>Do not paste tokens, secret URL parameters, or undisclosed vulnerabilities into a public issue. Follow the private process in <a href="https://github.com/dijkstra402/emoera-RAG-CLI/blob/main/SECURITY.md">SECURITY.md</a>.</p>
</DocsLayout>
